WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.910
Crouching medium punch punishes Ryu’s landing recovery.

2
00:00:00.910 --> 00:00:01.820
Back heavy punch links after the Punish Counter starter.

3
00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:03.400
Medium Renversé grabs Ryu as part of the combo.

4
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.130
Renversé ends with Ryu knocked down and Manon at two medals.

5
00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:04.650
Both characters return to their post-combo spacing.
